<i><b>Upgrade Notes</b></i>

* Requires NSP V1.41.0 or newer.

<b>V2.29.0 Release</b>

<b>Features</b>

* Add <b>Camera Input</b> feature for the uC-10.

* Add user definable splash screen iC-7 and uC-10.

* Add the following new ECU channels to the Haltech CAN broadcast protocol:
    * Torque Converter Pressure
    * Transfer Case Pressure
    * Air Conditioner Pressure
    * Air Condition Temperature
    * Power Steering Pressure
    * Fuel Consumption Average Economy
    * Fuel Consumption Instantaneous Economy
    * Intake Air Temperature Pre Intercooler
    * Boost Pressure Pre Intercooler
    * Generic Output 1-4 added.

* Add support for custom images for components in iC-7 and uC-10 dash screens
    * Allows uploading and downloading custom images to and from Dash
    * Allows custom images to replace existing Haltech images in Screen Image Components
    * Map files using custom Images can be saved and shared

* Add Light Control features to all dashes. This includes:
    * Headlights. Leave the outputs off to monitor the state of headlights.
    * Indicators.  Leave the outputs off to monitor the state of the indicators.
    * Brake Lights.
    * Reverse Lights.

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fixes state of some Haltech CAN channels not displaying correctly.

* Fixed Generic Outputs incorrectly showing as an enabled channel when the current CAN protocol does not support it.

* Fixes Nitrous Stage 1 Output State not available for Haltech Protocol

* Fixes Boost Control Output not available for Haltech Protocol

* Fixes lower warning colour on circular gauges not disappearing correctly when <i>Display Minimum</i> is equal to <i>Warning Minimum</i>

* Fixes the first label on circular gauges with long text covering adjacent components.

* <b>Exhaust Manifold Pressure</b> Sensor using <b>Engine Synchronous Voltage</b> now only shows relevant pin settings.
